WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:24.096
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:28.551 --> 00:00:30.530
Song Jae!

3
00:00:32.707 --> 00:00:34.765
Song Jae!

4
00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.561
Song Jae!

5
00:00:56.284 --> 00:00:57.942
Really... No.

6
00:01:03.277 --> 00:01:04.376
Song Jae...

7
00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:06.214
maybe we...

8
00:01:06.394 --> 00:01:09.091
there was no need to meet.

9
00:01:15.664 --> 00:01:18.442
Yes, there was no need.

10
00:01:31.009 --> 00:01:32.348
Hey Lim Seol!

11
00:01:33.566 --> 00:01:36.264
- This is my favorite!
- Give me the headphones.

12
00:01:36.404 --> 00:01:38.777
- Get up already!
- Wow!

13
00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:40.699
No, it can't be!

14
00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:42.817
This is crazy.

15
00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:47.648
- Such a cool song.
- Don’t talk! I like it too.

16
00:01:47.672 --> 00:01:49.730
Wait, listen to this one again.

17
00:01:52.587 --> 00:01:54.885
No, it was lying here!

18
00:01:58.182 --> 00:01:59.716
Put it back!

19
00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:03.956
- And listen to this one.
- This one is good too.

20
00:02:13.047 --> 00:02:15.265
34-1.

21
00:02:16.923 --> 00:02:18.462
They were probably mistaken.

22
00:03:49.431 --> 00:03:50.885
Sun Jae, listen to me!

23
00:03:50.909 --> 00:03:53.403
A ghost actually came to me!

24
00:03:53.427 --> 00:03:56.280
Did I ask for support? Was there such a thing?

25
00:03:56.304 --> 00:03:59.397
When I see you I feel
weak and defenseless!

26
00:03:59.421 --> 00:04:00.995
I'm disgusted!

27
00:04:01.019 --> 00:04:04.911
- Hold it.
- Is this why you sang in front of the whole audience?

28
00:04:04.935 --> 00:04:07.229
I said it myself, don’t worry so much!

29
00:04:07.253 --> 00:04:08.352
And what?

30
00:04:08.771 --> 00:04:11.229
- Can't I worry about you?
- Yes. It is forbidden.

31
00:04:11.888 --> 00:04:13.183
There is one last question left.

32
00:04:13.207 --> 00:04:16.619
And in no time where you found yourself,
Didn't you like me?

33
00:04:16.643 --> 00:04:17.742
No.

34
00:04:18.042 --> 00:04:19.141
I didn't like it.

35
00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:23.616
Sol, don't run away anymore.

36
00:04:24.316 --> 00:04:25.575
And don't hide your feelings.

37
00:04:26.314 --> 00:04:28.012
I will die saving you...

38
00:04:28.352 --> 00:04:29.451
...and okay.

39
00:04:30.669 --> 00:04:31.848
I don't care.

40
00:04:35.824 --> 00:04:37.882
Lim Sol, get in quickly!

41
00:04:38.382 --> 00:04:39.481
I'm coming.

42
00:04:55.205 --> 00:04:56.424
They're moving out, or what?

43
00:05:24.376 --> 00:05:25.933
Here's the title of the movie.
EPISODE 14

44
00:05:25.934 --> 00:05:27.588
EPISODE 14

45
00:05:27.612 --> 00:05:29.271
Do not open in advance!

46
00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:31.269
I understand.

47
00:05:32.168 --> 00:05:33.267
Let's pass.

48
00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.848
Wonderful evening!

49
00:06:12.607 --> 00:06:13.946
Song Jae...

50
00:06:24.955 --> 00:06:26.174
Who are you?

51
00:06:28.631 --> 00:06:29.930
I saw everything.

52
00:06:31.229 --> 00:06:32.408
What are you...

53
00:06:33.467 --> 00:06:34.566
was it stolen?

54
00:06:38.581 --> 00:06:40.839
No no.

55
00:06:41.139 --> 00:06:42.558
Sorry.

56
00:06:43.137 --> 00:06:44.356
Where are you going?

57
00:06:46.254 --> 00:06:47.353
Call the police?

58
00:06:51.528 --> 00:06:52.747
Why are you crying?

59
00:06:53.207 --> 00:06:54.466
I'm not crying.

60
00:06:56.284 --> 00:06:57.543
Why are you crying?

61
00:06:58.242 --> 00:06:59.381
I didn't cry.

62
00:07:11.868 --> 00:07:13.327
Do you think this will help?

63
00:07:20.779 --> 00:07:22.394
There you are, Ryu Sung Jae.

64
00:07:22.418 --> 00:07:24.236
Go to the waiting room.

65
00:07:34.286 --> 00:07:36.344
Give this to CEO Lee.

66
00:07:36.963 --> 00:07:38.062
And one more thing...

67
00:07:38.402 --> 00:07:40.260
security needs to be strengthened.

68
00:07:40.919 --> 00:07:42.134
There are thieves running around here.

69
00:07:42.158 --> 00:07:43.337
Thieves?

70
00:07:45.954 --> 00:07:49.091
I've been avoiding him for so many years,
and we met like this?

71
00:07:57.063 --> 00:08:00.076
But I don't remember Sun Jae being
at the film festival.

72
00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.279
What is he doing there?

73
00:08:01.858 --> 00:08:03.437
Presenting an award?

74
00:08:07.972 --> 00:08:09.071
This...

75
00:08:28.112 --> 00:08:32.204
This year has pleased us with many
brilliant work...

76
00:08:32.228 --> 00:08:33.642
Good evening.

77
00:08:33.666 --> 00:08:36.603
- Today...
- Hello. Will you eat?

78
00:08:37.063 --> 00:08:38.482
No appetite.

79
00:08:38.621 --> 00:08:40.675
First of all I want to say...

80
00:08:40.699 --> 00:08:43.117
- Did you take the application?
- I took it.

81
00:08:44.136 --> 00:08:45.235
Ladies and gentlemen...

82
00:08:46.134 --> 00:08:48.272
Why did I even write it?

83
00:08:50.649 --> 00:08:53.986
- For the "Best Film" award...
- What?

84
00:08:54.126 --> 00:08:58.661
Very soon we will find out the name
best picture of the year!

85
00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:04.576
I myself wonder what kind of film it became
the best this year.

86
00:09:04.795 --> 00:09:06.210
Title in envelope.

87
00:09:06.234 --> 00:09:09.051
- In the nomination...
- No, how can that be?

88
00:09:09.231 --> 00:09:12.088
"Best Film" wins...

89
00:09:13.307 --> 00:09:15.121
Song Jae-eh!

90
00:09:15.145 --> 00:09:17.682
"Figure it out yourself!" Congratulations!

91
00:09:19.141 --> 00:09:20.240
Wow!

92
00:09:21.818 --> 00:09:24.156
Yes. Go crazy.

93
00:09:27.612 --> 00:09:29.187
- Of course.
- Turn it off.

94
00:09:29.211 --> 00:09:30.510
Again.

95
00:09:31.449 --> 00:09:33.263
God, the articles have already come out.

96
00:09:33.287 --> 00:09:37.419
So. "Star Ryu Sung Jae starred
by the reputation of the film festival."

97
00:09:37.443 --> 00:09:39.536
How interesting!

98
00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:43.373
"The prestige of the ceremony has fallen" against
"It's just a funny mistake."

99
00:09:43.397 --> 00:09:44.851
Users argue online.

100
00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:50.246
Best film of the year - "Figure it out yourself!"?
Ryu Sung Jae needs to be dealt with.

101
00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.288
- Enough already.
- Sung Jae.

102
00:09:52.587 --> 00:09:53.686
Listen.

103
00:09:53.786 --> 00:09:57.483
They gave you an envelope right in your hands,
How could you have been so wrong?

104
00:09:57.862 --> 00:10:00.396
The ceremony turned into a courtyard!

105
00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:01.714
So here it is.

106
00:10:01.738 --> 00:10:03.113
Let's not get involved in this matter.

107
00:10:03.137 --> 00:10:05.910
Let CEO Lee figure it out herself
with your bag.

108
00:10:05.934 --> 00:10:09.187
- What do you have to do with it?
- Should I have stayed away?

109
00:10:09.211 --> 00:10:11.425
A man who did not stand aside.

110
00:10:11.449 --> 00:10:14.506
- Congratulations, Ryu Sung Jae! You...
- Shut your mouth!

111
00:10:14.925 --> 00:10:17.223
This was clearly not written by a sober person.

112
00:10:17.403 --> 00:10:20.340
It's kind of sad. I would do this myself
hit the CEO!

113
00:10:20.679 --> 00:10:21.778
Give it here.

114
00:10:21.878 --> 00:10:23.293
Whose side are you on?

115
00:10:23.317 --> 00:10:26.653
I'm because of this woman
disgraced the whole country!

116
00:10:27.073 --> 00:10:28.532
Shall we sue her?

117
00:10:28.951 --> 00:10:30.885
Don't be angry, Sung Jae.

118
00:10:30.909 --> 00:10:32.603
She is a poor office worker.

119
00:10:32.627 --> 00:10:37.203
And you know, every person thinks the same thing
what she wrote.

120
00:10:43.017 --> 00:10:45.590
Give it here. Give it here, Tong Seok!

121
00:10:45.614 --> 00:10:46.713
Song Jae!

122
00:10:46.853 --> 00:10:50.266
Maybe we can post this statement on the Internet.
and we'll explain everything?

123
00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:54.182
No need. In a day everything
they will forget about it and calm down.

124
00:10:54.206 --> 00:10:56.460
Fine. Our good Sung Jae.

125
00:10:56.484 --> 00:10:57.778
Who said good?

126
00:10:57.802 --> 00:10:58.657
- And what?
- And what?

127
00:10:58.681 --> 00:11:02.134
I shouldn't date anymore
with this woman.

128
00:11:02.158 --> 00:11:03.333
Never!

129
00:11:03.357 --> 00:11:05.974
- Wow.
- How scary.

130
00:11:07.233 --> 00:11:08.412
Very scary.

131
00:11:08.511 --> 00:11:09.610
Yes.

132
00:11:13.307 --> 00:11:15.085
Crap.

133
00:11:15.584 --> 00:11:17.523
Has she come again?

134
00:11:23.656 --> 00:11:24.755
Sorry.

135
00:11:31.528 --> 00:11:34.142
Sponsors will announce their decision
after

136
00:11:34.166 --> 00:11:36.420
how we will offer them replacements.

137
00:11:36.444 --> 00:11:39.860
There are already rumors that
that Park Do Joon will be replaced.

138
00:11:40.839 --> 00:11:42.414
- God.
- Sorry, Sung Jae.

139
00:11:42.438 --> 00:11:44.611
- Not bad.
- Why am I still alive?

140
00:11:44.635 --> 00:11:47.812
- I should have died!
- Maybe him?

141
00:11:48.232 --> 00:11:50.565
- Park Do Joon...
- Mrs. Li!

142
00:11:50.589 --> 00:11:54.286
Bo Ah is bad, but I can't
contact her father.

143
00:11:54.625 --> 00:11:57.962
- Where is this Lim Geum again?
- Let's.

144
00:12:00.979 --> 00:12:02.314
Who do you suggest?

145
00:12:02.338 --> 00:12:04.675
What? I... I suggest...

146
00:12:05.734 --> 00:12:06.953
I suggest...

147
00:12:07.453 --> 00:12:08.787
Ryu Sung Jae!

148
00:12:08.811 --> 00:12:09.906
Song Jae!

149
00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.109
Not him!

150
00:12:12.168 --> 00:12:13.267
Ryu Sung Jae?

151
00:12:18.841 --> 00:12:21.978
Do you think he will act
instead of Do Joon?

152
00:12:22.318 --> 00:12:24.655
But we can send him the script!

153
00:12:24.875 --> 00:12:27.688
Last time he refused to act,

154
00:12:27.712 --> 00:12:30.090
but he said that he was waiting for new proposals!

155
00:12:32.547 --> 00:12:35.241
Come on. This is out of politeness.

156
00:12:35.265 --> 00:12:40.240
And yet, if Ryu Sung Jae agrees,
Sponsors will be delighted!

157
00:12:42.977 --> 00:12:46.434
Then send him the script as soon as possible.
Fine?

158
00:12:46.533 --> 00:12:48.112
I'll call his manager.

159
00:12:48.571 --> 00:12:50.030
My God, how wonderful!

160
00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.107
Producer Lim, have you finalized the script?

161
00:12:55.085 --> 00:12:56.504
Producer Lim!

162
00:12:57.483 --> 00:12:58.582
What?

163
00:13:01.039 --> 00:13:03.333
Yes, I uploaded it to my email.

164
00:13:03.357 --> 00:13:04.655
I'll take a look.

165
00:13:04.795 --> 00:13:05.894
Fine.

166
00:13:06.593 --> 00:13:08.931
- Well!
- Really..

167
00:13:08.991 --> 00:13:10.565
No, he won't agree.

168
00:13:10.589 --> 00:13:12.328
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

169
00:13:16.663 --> 00:13:17.922
Yes, hello.

170
00:13:18.422 --> 00:13:20.356
Yes, sorry.

171
00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:22.114
I'm at work now.

172
00:13:22.138 --> 00:13:24.032
I'll tell my husband to come get Bo A.

173
00:13:24.056 --> 00:13:27.712
Yes, yes. Excuse me, please. Sorry.

174
00:13:45.075 --> 00:13:47.732
It seems there was a different name.

175
00:13:55.425 --> 00:13:58.242
This is the story of a tragic
deceased guy

176
00:13:58.462 --> 00:14:02.278
and the girl who is transported
15 years ago to save him.

177
00:14:02.857 --> 00:14:05.311
Fantastic melodrama
in which...

178
00:14:05.335 --> 00:14:09.990
fate brings the main characters together
and forces you to undergo a series of tests.

179
00:14:11.808 --> 00:14:14.665
When I realized that there was more
I won't be able to walk

180
00:14:15.524 --> 00:14:19.656
I prayed every night
so that the next day does not come.

181
00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.379
Every night.

182
00:14:21.558 --> 00:14:25.690
That day through the hospital room window
the morning rays of the sun were shining.

183
00:14:25.714 --> 00:14:27.533
It drove me crazy.

184
00:14:27.872 --> 00:14:32.208
When suddenly, by a stroke of luck,
I heard a man's voice.

185
00:14:32.707 --> 00:14:33.806
Therefore...

186
00:14:34.905 --> 00:14:36.044
move on with your life.

187
00:14:36.543 --> 00:14:38.122
The weather is good.

188
00:14:38.861 --> 00:14:40.560
Tomorrow it will rain

189
00:14:41.179 --> 00:14:45.275
so wait out the bad weather and live.

190
00:14:45.375 --> 00:14:49.790
And maybe someday you will
much easier.

191
00:14:51.528 --> 00:14:53.587
I was shivering from the cold...

192
00:14:54.006 --> 00:14:57.662
in the middle of the bridge near the Han River.
It was snowing heavily.

193
00:14:58.362 --> 00:15:01.175
Big, confident steps
he approached.

194
00:15:01.199 --> 00:15:03.736
And he handed me an umbrella.

195
00:15:10.669 --> 00:15:15.081
Sometimes we make a decision
already knowing the result.

196
00:15:15.105 --> 00:15:18.002
It suits us.

197
00:15:19.301 --> 00:15:20.400
I love you.

198
00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.997
The guy falls off a cliff and dies

199
00:15:23.377 --> 00:15:26.074
once again saving the girl.

200
00:15:26.653 --> 00:15:28.871
In 2009.

201
00:15:30.849 --> 00:15:32.108
You know...

202
00:15:32.687 --> 00:15:35.824
maybe we shouldn't have met.

203
00:15:36.484 --> 00:15:37.583
Yes...

204
00:15:38.122 --> 00:15:39.780
there was no need.

205
00:15:41.479 --> 00:15:46.653
The girl learns the terrible truth:
the guy died because of her.

206
00:15:46.713 --> 00:15:49.291
And decides to abandon his beloved.

207
00:15:51.269 --> 00:15:52.887
Erase yourself...

208
00:15:53.187 --> 00:15:54.765
from a guy's life.

209
00:15:57.463 --> 00:16:00.520
And he forgets everything connected with her.

210
00:16:00.659 --> 00:16:02.278
And he lives on.

211
00:16:03.097 --> 00:16:05.994
The girl watches him from afar,

212
00:16:06.254 --> 00:16:07.992
and wonders:

213
00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.869
"Did I make a mistake?

214
00:16:11.608 --> 00:16:15.864
We really weren't destined
meet?"

215
00:16:17.682 --> 00:16:20.540
"Torrential Rain" begins to sound quietly.

216
00:16:21.479 --> 00:16:22.737
Song...

217
00:16:23.636 --> 00:16:25.575
which only she remembers.

218
00:16:33.387 --> 00:16:34.526
What's happened?

219
00:16:38.142 --> 00:16:41.359
Song Jae! They sent the wrong script.

220
00:16:42.937 --> 00:16:44.875
- Sun Jae?
- Tong Sok.

221
00:16:45.654 --> 00:16:46.753
What?

222
00:16:48.252 --> 00:16:49.351
I...

223
00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:51.628
Am I crying now?

224
00:16:53.686 --> 00:16:55.105
It seems so.

225
00:16:55.844 --> 00:16:57.423
Are these tears?

226
00:16:57.922 --> 00:16:59.620
If it flows from the eyes...

227
00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.818
it's definitely not snot.

228
00:17:03.796 --> 00:17:05.375
For the first time in so many years...

229
00:17:08.551 --> 00:17:09.650
...Tong Sok.

230
00:17:13.467 --> 00:17:17.079
And the establishment is good.
It's probably expensive here.

231
00:17:17.103 --> 00:17:18.362
What kind of holiday?

232
00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.798
Will someone else come?

233
00:17:24.615 --> 00:17:29.786
To be honest, we sent it by mistake
Ryu Sung Jae is your other script.

234
00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:30.909
What?

235
00:17:31.808 --> 00:17:33.023
And further?

236
00:17:33.047 --> 00:17:37.103
He read it and told us
I'm so interested!

237
00:17:37.243 --> 00:17:38.342
What?

238
00:17:43.197 --> 00:17:44.296
In terms of?

239
00:17:44.476 --> 00:17:45.575
Is this her?

240
00:17:45.874 --> 00:17:48.448
- Do you know each other?
- “Figure it out yourself!”

241
00:17:48.472 --> 00:17:50.126
This is her masterpiece.

242
00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:51.728
Is it true?

243
00:17:52.547 --> 00:17:54.481
- Let's go already.
- I refuse.

244
00:17:54.505 --> 00:17:56.559
- Like this?
- Yes, I changed my mind.

245
00:17:56.583 --> 00:17:59.796
Sung Jae, don't be led by your emotions,
You can't do that!

246
00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:01.718
It's not about emotions at all.

247
00:18:01.978 --> 00:18:05.195
This scenario is doomed to fail.

248
00:18:06.454 --> 00:18:07.553
Wait.

249
00:18:08.252 --> 00:18:09.351
No.

250
00:18:10.769 --> 00:18:12.947
I'll tell her myself that I refuse.

251
00:18:13.087 --> 00:18:14.581
I think about the success of the film.

252
00:18:14.605 --> 00:18:16.224
It's not about her. Is it true.

253
00:18:18.801 --> 00:18:20.935
- My God, hello.
- No.

254
00:18:20.959 --> 00:18:23.936
- Come on in...
- No, no way.

255
00:18:24.076 --> 00:18:25.175
Sit down.

256
00:18:25.954 --> 00:18:27.413
I beg you.

257
00:18:32.947 --> 00:18:34.206
Glad to see you for the first time.

258
00:18:35.025 --> 00:18:37.203
No. She's not the first.

259
00:18:37.423 --> 00:18:38.522
Come on.

260
00:18:38.741 --> 00:18:40.200
Have you met yet?

261
00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:41.638
Where?

262
00:18:45.335 --> 00:18:46.474
No.

263
00:18:46.693 --> 00:18:48.232
I probably misspoke.

264
00:18:48.691 --> 00:18:54.022
Here's how. Mister Ryu apparently
you really liked the script.

265
00:18:54.046 --> 00:18:56.783
What a gorgeous bouquet you brought.

266
00:18:57.642 --> 00:19:00.500
To be honest, it's not from me.

267
00:19:00.919 --> 00:19:04.016
- Actually, I refused...
- Sorry.

268
00:19:04.875 --> 00:19:08.931
I wish you would refuse
from this role, Sung Jae.

269
00:19:08.991 --> 00:19:10.090
