What a bastard.

539
00:36:10.250 --> 00:36:12.983
Where did you run off to again in the middle of the night?

540
00:36:13.007 --> 00:36:15.784
Are you losing everything at cards again?

541
00:36:16.204 --> 00:36:18.657
Wait, don't, let him go...

542
00:36:18.681 --> 00:36:22.613
No, the casino doesn't smell like flowers.
You've been hanging around brothels, right?

543
00:36:22.637 --> 00:36:24.731
Which girl did you mess with?

544
00:36:24.755 --> 00:36:25.970
Who did you visit?

545
00:36:25.994 --> 00:36:28.208
From whom? The one from last time?

546
00:36:28.232 --> 00:36:30.366
- Which one, I ask!
- Grandma, I...

547
00:36:30.390 --> 00:36:34.286
So my daughter fell for it
on your face.

548
00:36:34.585 --> 00:36:36.000
Got married at 17.

549
00:36:36.024 --> 00:36:38.398
And now she sits at home with the children, stupid.

550
00:36:38.422 --> 00:36:40.955
Lord... Lord...

551
00:36:40.979 --> 00:36:42.318
Sung Jae, Song Jae.

552
00:36:43.297 --> 00:36:46.913
- She has dementia.
- Lord...

553
00:36:49.770 --> 00:36:51.069
Grandma...

554
00:36:51.329 --> 00:36:52.707
Grandma...

555
00:36:57.562 --> 00:36:59.496
Wait. Did you get on the bus?

556
00:36:59.520 --> 00:37:00.619
Just a second.

557
00:37:04.196 --> 00:37:06.050
Yes, in '72.

558
00:37:06.074 --> 00:37:09.251
Check all cameras.
Look where she came out.

559
00:37:13.706 --> 00:37:15.085
Yes, mom.

560
00:37:15.385 --> 00:37:17.998
I'm with Tae Sung. We are looking at the recordings
from the cameras now.

561
00:37:18.022 --> 00:37:20.116
Salt, grandma has been found.

562
00:37:20.140 --> 00:37:23.197
What? Found it? Where?

563
00:37:23.497 --> 00:37:25.391
In some restaurant.

564
00:37:25.415 --> 00:37:28.068
The owner saw the number in the photo
and called.

565
00:37:28.092 --> 00:37:31.589
He will bring her home.
Come back quickly.

566
00:37:33.247 --> 00:37:34.945
How good.

567
00:37:35.884 --> 00:37:36.983
Salt...

568
00:37:52.867 --> 00:37:55.445
Thank you for finding time for me.

569
00:37:56.104 --> 00:37:57.722
I'm free for you.

570
00:37:57.862 --> 00:37:59.720
How are you without a car?

571
00:37:59.900 --> 00:38:01.159
It's dangerous outside.

572
00:38:01.299 --> 00:38:04.356
- Did something happen?
- The girl was almost kidnapped.

573
00:38:04.496 --> 00:38:06.633
No trace, no suspect.

574
00:38:07.213 --> 00:38:09.387
Try to come back early.

575
00:38:09.411 --> 00:38:10.510
Understood?

576
00:38:10.809 --> 00:38:12.468
If you're running late, call.

577
00:38:12.647 --> 00:38:14.066
I'll give you a ride.

578
00:38:14.725 --> 00:38:17.498
No need. Your girlfriends
you'll give me a ride.

579
00:38:17.522 --> 00:38:19.021
So you were my girlfriend.

580
00:38:19.361 --> 00:38:20.695
Since when am I a girlfriend?

581
00:38:20.719 --> 00:38:22.018
Well, not a friend.

582
00:38:22.238 --> 00:38:23.337
Girlfriend.

583
00:38:25.714 --> 00:38:27.453
You're not friends with girls.

584
00:38:31.189 --> 00:38:32.288
Yes, I'm listening.

585
00:38:32.867 --> 00:38:34.725
- Now?
- Go quickly.

586
00:38:35.624 --> 00:38:36.843
I'll be there now.

587
00:38:38.262 --> 00:38:39.361
Go home.

588
00:38:39.580 --> 00:38:41.239
You'll call later.

589
00:38:41.538 --> 00:38:43.197
- Good luck!
- I'll go.

590
00:38:44.535 --> 00:38:45.634
Bye!

591
00:38:52.807 --> 00:38:54.146
Your boyfriend?

592
00:38:58.442 --> 00:39:00.815
And you... Why are you here...

593
00:39:00.839 --> 00:39:02.214
So cute.

594
00:39:02.238 --> 00:39:03.532
We're not dating!

595
00:39:03.556 --> 00:39:08.448
And you don't have to come to my house.
It scares me, you know!

596
00:39:08.472 --> 00:39:10.170
Yes? How's that?

597
00:39:17.502 --> 00:39:18.961
What are you doing?

598
00:39:19.461 --> 00:39:21.998
I won't get in this car.

599
00:39:22.098 --> 00:39:23.756
There is nothing more to say.

600
00:39:24.256 --> 00:39:26.030
That's it, leave.

601
00:39:26.054 --> 00:39:27.513
Are you kicking me out?

602
00:39:28.252 --> 00:39:29.307
Won't you regret it?

603
00:39:29.331 --> 00:39:30.510
I won't regret it!

604
00:39:30.689 --> 00:39:32.264
I have already refused you.

605
00:39:32.288 --> 00:39:34.546
There is no need to see each other anymore.

606
00:39:35.964 --> 00:39:37.423
She said I won’t sit down!

607
00:39:37.483 --> 00:39:40.540
What? Will you threaten to make a statement again?

608
00:39:42.078 --> 00:39:43.257
Are you having fun?

609
00:39:43.556 --> 00:39:45.095
Yes. Funny.

610
00:39:45.475 --> 00:39:48.012
Is it fun to play with someone else's work?

611
00:39:48.072 --> 00:39:50.330
Better tell everything to CEO Lee.

612
00:39:50.509 --> 00:39:53.842
If you keep running after me,
I won't stand it.

613
00:39:53.866 --> 00:39:55.525
I'll just quit!

614
00:39:58.142 --> 00:40:00.080
How he has changed.

615
00:40:02.817 --> 00:40:09.431
Forget it already! Forget about this movie
and leave me alone!

616
00:40:11.528 --> 00:40:13.906
Sister, where are you going?

617
00:40:16.643 --> 00:40:19.936
The restaurant owner promised to bring...

618
00:40:19.960 --> 00:40:21.459
This is my father.

619
00:40:22.078 --> 00:40:23.177
Are you surprised?

620
00:40:24.356 --> 00:40:26.254
I haven't been to a restaurant for a long time.

621
00:40:27.153 --> 00:40:28.811
And this is the situation.

622
00:40:31.908 --> 00:40:33.766
Oh my God, hello.

623
00:40:34.226 --> 00:40:36.040
I was going to go after her.

624
00:40:36.064 --> 00:40:38.082
Thank you for bringing it.

625
00:40:38.222 --> 00:40:42.314
Wait. It’s inconvenient to let you go like this.
Maybe we can treat you?

626
00:40:42.338 --> 00:40:44.476
No no. Go home.

627
00:40:45.295 --> 00:40:48.951
- Sister, I'm torn.
- Got it, got it.

628
00:40:49.011 --> 00:40:51.664
And yet, you can’t just
let go.

629
00:40:51.688 --> 00:40:53.782
I really want to go to the toilet.

630
00:40:53.806 --> 00:40:56.260
Okay, mom. Wait. Wait. Wait.

631
00:40:56.284 --> 00:40:59.816
Salt, treat the young man
a cup of tea.

632
00:40:59.840 --> 00:41:02.813
Yes. Then we'll go.
Thank you very much.

633
00:41:02.837 --> 00:41:05.131
Thank you. Thank you. Let's go, let's go.

634
00:41:05.155 --> 00:41:07.968
Let's go, Mal Ja, let's go.
That's it, let's go.

635
00:41:07.992 --> 00:41:10.689
- I want to go to the toilet!
- Let's go, let's go, now.

636
00:41:13.706 --> 00:41:14.805
Take it.

637
00:41:14.905 --> 00:41:17.283
I didn't understand everything correctly.

638
00:41:17.862 --> 00:41:20.679
Thank you for bringing grandma.

639
00:41:27.692 --> 00:41:29.630
Treat me to tea.

640
00:41:33.367 --> 00:41:34.905
Here's your tea.

641
00:41:35.365 --> 00:41:37.978
This is how you thank a person, right?

642
00:41:38.002 --> 00:41:40.575
There are no cafes nearby at this time
doesn't work.

643
00:41:40.599 --> 00:41:43.453
What if reporters notice us?
and start rumors

644
00:41:43.477 --> 00:41:44.655
will you answer?

645
00:41:46.753 --> 00:41:48.731
- There's no one here.
- Doesn't matter.

646
00:41:49.351 --> 00:41:51.165
I don't need scandals.

647
00:41:51.189 --> 00:41:54.366
I am an actor in melodramas.

648
00:41:55.544 --> 00:41:57.003
Since when?

649
00:42:00.500 --> 00:42:02.038
- What is this?
- So.

650
00:42:05.215 --> 00:42:06.314
Look.

651
00:42:08.771 --> 00:42:10.909
I heard a sound from a melodrama.

652
00:42:11.489 --> 00:42:12.588
What?

653
00:42:15.405 --> 00:42:16.703
The moment is right!

654
00:42:18.042 --> 00:42:22.378
Have you seen it? Advertisers are happy
in my fresh way.

655
00:42:22.877 --> 00:42:27.413
You arranged this so that I would agree
cast you?

656
00:42:27.592 --> 00:42:30.925
No way.
I'm just stating the facts.

657
00:42:30.949 --> 00:42:34.326
I'm still fresh and doing great
with melodrama.

658
00:42:35.025 --> 00:42:36.763
You're missing your chance.

659
00:42:37.942 --> 00:42:39.441
Is it true?

660
00:42:41.339 --> 00:42:43.597
Damn it. We already found out.

661
00:42:45.095 --> 00:42:46.913
To avoid a scandal...

662
00:42:47.133 --> 00:42:48.751
pretend to be a stylist.

663
00:42:48.811 --> 00:42:50.430
- What?
- Well...

664
00:42:50.729 --> 00:42:51.988
you are dressed so-so.

665
00:42:52.887 --> 00:42:53.986
Girls!

666
00:42:54.326 --> 00:42:55.585
Don't be shy, come over.

667
00:42:56.204 --> 00:42:57.662
Eat!

668
00:42:58.801 --> 00:43:01.618
What do you want? Photo? Autograph?

669
00:43:03.437 --> 00:43:06.014
Uncle, buy us cigarettes.

670
00:43:09.471 --> 00:43:10.969
Didn't you find out?

671
00:43:11.389 --> 00:43:13.646
- What?
- What's wrong with him?

672
00:43:22.977 --> 00:43:24.076
Understood!

673
00:43:24.296 --> 00:43:26.753
Buy yourself a coffee with your change.

674
00:43:27.053 --> 00:43:28.152
Thank you.

675
00:43:28.212 --> 00:43:29.870
What other cigarettes?

676
00:43:31.169 --> 00:43:32.268
Hold it.

677
00:43:32.887 --> 00:43:33.986
Go away!

678
00:43:34.046 --> 00:43:38.661
- Kind of strange.
- It infuriates me. Let's get out of here.

679
00:43:42.557 --> 00:43:45.375
- Funny?
- Yes, very much.

680
00:43:50.629 --> 00:43:52.048
This is the first time I've seen this.

681
00:43:59.141 --> 00:44:01.119
- That's it, did you laugh?
- Yes.

682
00:44:15.684 --> 00:44:16.783
Well...

683
00:44:17.682 --> 00:44:18.781
goodbye.

684
00:44:21.798 --> 00:44:24.975
It turns out we were neighbors.
Dad told me.

685
00:44:25.075 --> 00:44:26.853
Did your family have a store?

686
00:44:27.433 --> 00:44:28.691
We lived nearby.

687
00:44:29.271 --> 00:44:30.769
And you've never met?

688
00:44:32.428 --> 00:44:33.527
No.

689
00:44:34.066 --> 00:44:35.405
Haven't met.

690
00:44:36.264 --> 00:44:38.242
So, I saw you somewhere.

691
00:44:39.301 --> 00:44:41.479
You seemed familiar to me.

692
00:44:43.177 --> 00:44:46.354
I've never seen you before
where could you see me?

693
00:44:47.133 --> 00:44:48.232
And it's true.

694
00:44:49.131 --> 00:44:50.230
Wait.

695
00:44:50.609 --> 00:44:52.188
What do shamans say?

696
00:44:52.408 --> 00:44:55.465
Whether you saw it or not, it doesn't matter.

697
00:44:55.924 --> 00:44:57.023
This is fate.

698
00:44:58.641 --> 00:44:59.740
This...

699
00:45:01.039 --> 00:45:02.378
...coincidence.

700
00:45:03.756 --> 00:45:04.855
Coincidence.

701
00:45:07.872 --> 00:45:11.285
What, we were neighbors
doesn't mean anything.

702
00:45:11.309 --> 00:45:14.965
Even if the CEO is
persuade you...

703
00:45:15.504 --> 00:45:16.883
...refuse.

704
00:45:17.063 --> 00:45:21.199
What if I agree to this offer?
contrary to your request.

705
00:45:21.738 --> 00:45:23.077
What will happen?

706
00:45:25.295 --> 00:45:28.232
I wouldn't want that.

707
00:45:30.050 --> 00:45:31.149
Well...

708
00:45:31.528 --> 00:45:32.867
...I'll go.

709
00:45:46.553 --> 00:45:47.652
Look.

710
00:45:50.709 --> 00:45:53.567
- Funny?
- Yes, very much.

711
00:46:07.772 --> 00:46:11.908
Forget it already! Forget about this movie
and leave me alone!

712
00:46:42.498 --> 00:46:43.876
I'm home.

713
00:46:44.136 --> 00:46:47.153
Wow. So fast? Has he already left?

714
00:46:47.932 --> 00:46:48.987
Yes.

715
00:46:49.011 --> 00:46:50.789
He said he didn't need anything.

716
00:46:51.369 --> 00:46:54.026
-Where are Hyun Joo and Geum?
- Putting the children to bed.

717
00:46:54.246 --> 00:46:56.579
By the way, the man is on the phone
there was another voice.

718
00:46:56.603 --> 00:46:58.262
It's not him.

719
00:46:59.321 --> 00:47:01.135
Don't know. Maybe an employee.

720
00:47:01.159 --> 00:47:03.892
No. Look at his walk.

721
00:47:03.916 --> 00:47:06.494
He has a nice face and is tall.

722
00:47:06.713 --> 00:47:09.291
I definitely saw him somewhere.

723
00:47:10.390 --> 00:47:11.489
So.

724
00:47:11.988 --> 00:47:13.087
Yes!

725
00:47:13.187 --> 00:47:14.286
In the series.

726
00:47:14.865 --> 00:47:16.004
Ryu...

727
00:47:16.424 --> 00:47:17.762
Ryu...

728
00:47:19.301 --> 00:47:22.278
Ryu Sung Jae! Exactly, exactly. Ryu Sung Jae.

729
00:47:22.458 --> 00:47:24.396
Of course not. What are you doing, mom?

730
00:47:25.135 --> 00:47:26.993
No, it's him!

731
00:47:28.092 --> 00:47:29.391
Stay here, mom.

732
00:47:30.529 --> 00:47:32.348
I want to eat.

733
00:47:32.847 --> 00:47:34.106
Grandmother!

734
00:47:34.685 --> 00:47:37.299
Don't go anywhere else.

735
00:47:37.323 --> 00:47:39.780
How did you even end up there?

736
00:47:40.240 --> 00:47:41.854
Don't go there again.

737
00:47:41.878 --> 00:47:42.977
Understood?

738
00:47:43.756 --> 00:47:44.855
Yes.

739
00:47:48.671 --> 00:47:50.729
But grandma is great.

740
00:47:50.989 --> 00:47:53.247
- What?
- You were bored.

741
00:47:56.464 --> 00:47:58.402
Mom, come here!

742
00:47:58.541 --> 00:47:59.840
I'm coming!

743
00:48:20.040 --> 00:48:22.218
Yes, grandma.

744
00:48:23.237 --> 00:48:24.735
I missed you.

745
00:48:29.351 --> 00:48:30.849
Doesn't matter.

746
00:48:31.309 --> 00:48:32.408
This is fate.

747
00:48:36.064 --> 00:48:38.162
It won't work that way.

748
00:48:38.422 --> 00:48:40.160
If I see him...

749
00:48:41.059 --> 00:48:42.598
I'll miss you.

750
00:48:50.210 --> 00:48:51.864
She ran away from home.

751
00:48:51.888 --> 00:48:56.064
The same person tried to kidnap her
what is behind the last kidnapping.

752
00:48:56.164 --> 00:48:59.496
Luckily the girl is on time
called for help

753
00:48:59.520 --> 00:49:01.299
and she managed to escape.

754
00:49:04.156 --> 00:49:05.415
Have you calmed down?

755
00:49:08.112 --> 00:49:09.730
Shall we wait for the parents?

756
00:49:10.470 --> 00:49:11.569
No.

757
00:49:13.107 --> 00:49:14.685
I'll tell you everything.

758
00:49:15.425 --> 00:49:16.524
Fine.

759
00:49:18.981 --> 00:49:21.638
Maybe you saw him?

760
00:49:22.617 --> 00:49:23.716
Yes.

761
00:49:24.775 --> 00:49:26.274
I understand it's hard...

762
00:49:26.813 --> 00:49:28.472
but describe it.

763
00:49:30.210 --> 00:49:32.308
Hyun Joo! Hyun Joo!

764
00:49:32.408 --> 00:49:34.186
Hyun Joo, Hyun Joo, Hyun Joo!

765
00:49:34.446 --> 00:49:38.502
I have already assembled Bo Ah, she is ready.
Look how beautiful it is!

766
00:49:38.761 --> 00:49:41.379
Heart! And more! Look!

767
00:49:43.916 --> 00:49:45.810
Should I give you a massage?
I'm probably tired...

768
00:49:45.834 --> 00:49:49.486
Wow! How beautiful you are, daughter.

769
00:49:49.510 --> 00:49:53.207
Bo Ah, mom is busy today,
so dad will take you.

770
00:49:54.346 --> 00:49:58.562
You know, dad, it seems like mom
doesn't notice you.

771
00:50:00.260 --> 00:50:02.873
Dad just put on the invisibility cloak.

772
00:50:02.897 --> 00:50:05.515
Only beauties see me!

773
00:50:10.609 --> 00:50:12.104
Bo Ah, let's go. Say goodbye.

774
00:50:12.128 --> 00:50:13.702
- Bye, mom!
- Bye!

775
00:50:13.726 --> 00:50:14.985
Kiss mom.

776
00:50:15.724 --> 00:50:17.902
- Bye, Bo A.
- And dad.

777
00:50:21.079 --> 00:50:22.538
Good luck, dear.

778
00:50:23.796 --> 00:50:25.335
How infuriating!

779
00:50:26.474 --> 00:50:30.130
Where's my scarf? Where is he?

780
00:50:34.945 --> 00:50:36.044
What is this?

781
00:50:36.344 --> 00:50:39.760
This idiot is wasting our money again.

782
00:50:39.860 --> 00:50:41.634
Hyun Joo! Aren't you coming?

783
00:50:41.658 --> 00:50:43.037
I'm coming!

784
00:50:44.056 --> 00:50:45.155
What?

785
00:50:45.614 --> 00:50:48.552
- Why?
- I mean, why?

786
00:50:48.611 --> 00:50:50.709
Are there any reasons for this?

787
00:50:51.009 --> 00:50:54.306
He probably liked the script.

788
00:50:55.365 --> 00:50:56.703
I don't agree.

789
00:50:57.123 --> 00:50:58.462
So what next?

790
00:50:58.601 --> 00:50:59.780
What to do?

791
00:51:01.439 --> 00:51:04.655
Do you think it will be easy for us
find a replacement for him?

792
00:51:05.475 --> 00:51:08.212
I don't understand why you refuse.

793
00:51:08.671 --> 00:51:10.370
And she refused at the meeting.

794
00:51:10.589 --> 00:51:13.123
Don't you want to consult us?

795
00:51:13.147 --> 00:51:14.366
This is no joke!

796
00:51:15.385 --> 00:51:17.123
The matter with Do Joon needs to be hushed up.

797
00:51:17.742 --> 00:51:20.520
We can't do without Ryu Sung Jae.

798
00:51:21.379 --> 00:51:23.197
Nobody asked you.

799
00:51:25.614 --> 00:51:26.713
Fine.

800
00:51:26.893 --> 00:51:28.512
Make a movie.

801
00:51:29.251 --> 00:51:30.350
I...

802
00:51:30.689 --> 00:51:31.948
...I quit.

803
00:51:34.446 --> 00:51:36.460
What, are you organizing a protest?

804
00:51:36.484 --> 00:51:38.142
No.

805
00:51:38.282 --> 00:51:41.978
I really can't work with Sung Jae.
No. I can't.

806
00:51:42.797 --> 00:51:45.015
So I'm abandoning the script...

807
00:51:45.435 --> 00:51:46.933
and I quit.

808
00:51:51.349 --> 00:51:53.007
What? You...

809
00:51:53.586 --> 00:51:55.525
-Are you serious?
- Thank you...

810
00:51:57.782 --> 00:51:59.121
to you for everything.

811
00:52:02.258 --> 00:52:03.357
Salt!

812
00:52:03.536 --> 00:52:04.635
Salt.

813
00:52:06.094 --> 00:52:07.393
Salt!

814
00:52:08.452 --> 00:52:10.785
What's wrong with you? Are you out of your mind?

815
00:52:10.809 --> 00:52:12.583
Yes, in my mind.

816
00:52:12.607 --> 00:52:14.142
What's wrong with me?

817
00:52:14.166 --> 00:52:18.302
If you hadn't gotten the script wrong,
nothing would have happened.

818
00:52:18.881 --> 00:52:19.980
Salt...

819
00:52:20.759 --> 00:52:22.853
but on the contrary it’s good.

820
00:52:22.877 --> 00:52:24.136
No.

821
00:52:24.835 --> 00:52:28.372
I left him. How can I now
look at him?

822
00:52:29.391 --> 00:52:31.648
We can't see each other.

823
00:52:35.025 --> 00:52:36.284
Salt...

824
00:52:37.223 --> 00:52:38.881
What is it? Everything is fine?

825
00:52:42.458 --> 00:52:47.433
And who came up with the idea of filming?
outside in winter?

826
00:52:47.852 --> 00:52:49.706
It's good that it's warm today.

827
00:52:49.730 --> 00:52:50.829
Tong Seok...

828
00:52:50.929 --> 00:52:52.747
Have you heard "Priving Rain"?

829
00:52:53.327 --> 00:52:54.941
This is a popular name.

830
00:52:54.965 --> 00:52:57.463
There are a couple of such songs. Which one are you talking about?

831
00:52:58.761 --> 00:52:59.860
Forget.

832
00:53:01.079 --> 00:53:05.451
By the way, CEO Lee called.
We made an appointment.

833
00:53:05.475 --> 00:53:09.646
But she said instead of Lim Sol
another producer will come.

834
00:53:09.670 --> 00:53:12.164
- Why?
- She refused the script.

835
00:53:12.188 --> 00:53:14.122
Refused? This is her script.

836
00:53:14.146 --> 00:53:19.081
Yes. What's wrong with this movie?
what did you get into with him?

837
00:53:23.257 --> 00:53:24.396
For the sake of my beloved...

838
00:53:25.055 --> 00:53:29.750
girl goes back in time
15 years ago.

839
00:53:31.728 --> 00:53:33.826
Nothing special.

840
00:53:34.086 --> 00:53:35.305
And it's true.

841
00:53:35.644 --> 00:53:37.263
Nothing special.

842
00:53:38.162 --> 00:53:39.261
Strange.

843
00:53:42.757 --> 00:53:44.456
And the phone is turned off.

844
00:53:44.915 --> 00:53:47.093
She couldn't quit, could she?

845
00:53:48.192 --> 00:53:49.291
Don't think.

846
00:53:49.630 --> 00:53:52.208
The CEO didn't take it seriously.

847
00:53:53.467 --> 00:53:55.560
I'll talk to her again at home.

848
00:53:55.584 --> 00:53:59.437
She dreamed of becoming a director
and now such a chance has come.

849
00:53:59.461 --> 00:54:01.079
Very strange.

850
00:54:01.618 --> 00:54:03.836
What did Sun Jae do to her?

851
00:54:04.136 --> 00:54:07.513
You can't hate a person without a reason.

852
00:54:09.331 --> 00:54:10.430
What's happened?

853
00:54:12.408 --> 00:54:13.866
What's happened?

854
00:54:15.764 --> 00:54:17.143
Damn it...

855
00:54:33.427 --> 00:54:36.044
But here nothing has changed at all.

856
00:54:52.647 --> 00:54:55.744
We'll meet in the future and come here.

857
00:55:02.398 --> 00:55:05.175
It's a pity that there are no photos left.

858
00:55:05.554 --> 00:55:06.653
Exactly.

859
00:55:07.712 --> 00:55:09.491
This did not happen.

860
00:55:26.613 --> 00:55:27.712
My God.

861
00:55:29.211 --> 00:55:31.389
How quickly time flies.

862
00:55:44.635 --> 00:55:45.734
Salt!

863
00:55:54.985 --> 00:55:56.084
Song Jae.

864
00:55:56.384 --> 00:55:57.878
That's all for today.

865
00:55:57.902 --> 00:56:01.479
- Why?
- The actress got wet through and through on the way.

866
00:56:01.818 --> 00:56:03.477
- Everything is fine?
- Yes.

867
00:56:03.736 --> 00:56:04.991
What can I do?

868
00:56:05.015 --> 00:56:06.190
It's cold outside.

869
00:56:06.214 --> 00:56:09.391
I quickly run to the car.
Let's. I'll be quick!

870
00:56:20.919 --> 00:56:22.138
This is him.

871
00:56:23.836 --> 00:56:24.935
Tae Sung!

872
00:56:25.874 --> 00:56:27.772
- Here is an identikit.
- Come here.

873
00:56:33.267 --> 00:56:34.366
This is him.

874
00:56:39.780 --> 00:56:41.075
Wait a moment.

875
00:56:41.099 --> 00:56:43.157
That's it, come on in.

876
00:56:44.056 --> 00:56:45.954
- Like this.
- I'll come in.

877
00:56:51.608 --> 00:56:53.303
Wait. What are you here...

878
00:56:53.327 --> 00:56:55.505
Are you afraid that I'm watching you?

879
00:56:56.324 --> 00:56:59.017
I came to the shoot, but it was cancelled.

880
00:56:59.041 --> 00:57:02.218
I remembered the scene
on the Ferris wheel.

881
00:57:02.358 --> 00:57:03.736
So we met.

882
00:57:05.634 --> 00:57:07.808
Remember what I told you?

883
00:57:07.832 --> 00:57:09.327
This is not a coincidence.

884
00:57:09.351 --> 00:57:10.925
Fate itself brought us together.

885
00:57:10.949 --> 00:57:12.483
You accidentally noticed me.

886
00:57:12.507 --> 00:57:15.125
Well, we would have passed by.
Why did you sit here?

887
00:57:15.385 --> 00:57:17.962
You and I are not in the same relationship...

888
00:57:18.821 --> 00:57:19.920
Ryu Sung Jae.

889
00:57:25.375 --> 00:57:28.032
With all the desire from here
no way to escape.

890
00:57:30.090 --> 00:57:31.269
Are you thinking about this?

891
00:57:35.564 --> 00:57:38.102
Until the circle ends, you will be here.

892
00:57:43.357 --> 00:57:44.815
Do you hate me?

893
00:57:45.914 --> 00:57:49.171
Is that why they abandoned the script?

894
00:57:50.150 --> 00:57:51.249
Yes.

895
00:57:51.708 --> 00:57:53.363
But I already quit.

896
00:57:53.387 --> 00:57:54.486
Why?

897
00:57:54.745 --> 00:57:56.244
I wouldn't want that.

898
00:57:56.823 --> 00:57:58.282
What do you care?

899
00:58:03.177 --> 00:58:04.276
Are you feeling bad?

900
00:58:04.895 --> 00:58:05.994
No.

901
00:58:06.533 --> 00:58:08.352
Let's keep quiet.

902
00:58:13.007 --> 00:58:14.146
Really...

903
00:58:14.486 --> 00:58:16.344
Is this where it all ends?

904
00:58:17.003 --> 00:58:18.941
- What are you talking about?
- About history.

905
00:58:20.280 --> 00:58:21.379
Guy...

906
00:58:21.718 --> 00:58:24.376
I forgot everything about my beloved girl...

907
00:58:24.795 --> 00:58:26.214
and continued to live?

908
00:58:28.152 --> 00:58:29.251
Yes.

909
00:58:30.909 --> 00:58:32.248
Sad ending.

910
00:58:34.625 --> 00:58:36.004
No, happy.

911
00:58:36.424 --> 00:58:37.802
For a girl.

912
00:58:38.581 --> 00:58:40.200
She saved him.

913
00:58:40.300 --> 00:58:41.918
But I lost love.

914
00:58:47.652 --> 00:58:50.430
Can she really be happy?

915
00:58:51.808 --> 00:58:52.907
Here you go.

916
00:58:53.007 --> 00:58:54.426
Sad ending.

917
00:58:55.405 --> 00:58:56.983
I don't like.

918
00:58:57.802 --> 00:58:59.940
If you don't like it, you don't like it.

919
00:59:00.120 --> 00:59:01.494
Why are you bothering?

920
00:59:01.518 --> 00:59:03.816
Now everything is for real.

921
00:59:04.515 --> 00:59:06.050
I want to star in a film.

922
00:59:06.074 --> 00:59:08.452
Why did you become attached to him?

923
00:59:08.551 --> 00:59:11.928
I'm sure there will be scripts,
and better producers!

924
00:59:19.021 --> 00:59:20.120
With me...

925
00:59:21.499 --> 00:59:23.597
something strange is happening.

926
00:59:25.495 --> 00:59:27.313
It started after...

927
00:59:27.852 --> 00:59:29.830
as I read your script.

928
00:59:30.929 --> 00:59:32.627
I cry often...

929
00:59:33.526 --> 00:59:34.625
and I see dreams.

930
00:59:35.165 --> 00:59:37.622
And in these dreams everything seems to be in reality.

931
00:59:43.197 --> 00:59:44.376
And this place...

932
01:00:16.444 --> 01:00:18.422
seems familiar to me.

933
01:00:19.241 --> 01:00:21.059
I've been here once before.

934
01:00:22.038 --> 01:00:23.377
Song Jae...

935
01:00:23.876 --> 01:00:25.175
That's how things are.

936
01:00:25.794 --> 01:00:27.493
I'm drawn to your...

937
01:00:27.872 --> 01:00:28.971
...script.

938
01:00:30.390 --> 01:00:31.608
What to do?

939
01:00:35.664 --> 01:00:37.123
You will die.

940
01:00:38.981 --> 01:00:40.520
You will die...

941
01:00:41.698 --> 01:00:43.796
if you agree.

942
01:00:45.015 --> 01:00:46.394
Do you understand?

943
01:00:47.373 --> 01:00:48.951
That is, if I agree...

944
01:00:49.371 --> 01:00:51.309
then I will certainly die?

945
01:00:52.168 --> 01:00:53.547
That's right.

946
01:01:11.948 --> 01:01:13.287
Why are you silent?

947
01:01:13.467 --> 01:01:14.605
Beautiful.

948
01:01:16.543 --> 01:01:18.841
So beautiful that I have no words.

949
01:01:51.389 --> 01:01:52.488
It seems...

950
01:01:53.307 --> 01:01:55.045
we will die here together.

951
01:02:02.977 --> 01:02:04.715
At that moment I thought.

952
01:02:05.574 --> 01:02:06.993
Maybe our destiny...

953
01:02:07.493 --> 01:02:09.990
constantly going in circles,

954
01:02:10.210 --> 01:02:11.908
like this ferris wheel?

955
01:02:43.297 --> 01:02:46.354
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

956
01:02:47.333 --> 01:02:50.669
- Sung Jae...
- I'm here. You go to sleep.

957
01:02:50.809 --> 01:02:52.907
He appears here often.

958
01:02:52.967 --> 01:02:55.101
I heard Sol didn't take you for the role.

959
01:02:55.125 --> 01:02:57.543
Me too. She doesn't have a boyfriend.

960
01:02:57.962 --> 01:02:59.221
Give it to her?

961
01:02:59.401 --> 01:03:00.775
Or just leave...

962
01:03:00.799 --> 01:03:03.133
Producer Lim quit.

963
01:03:03.157 --> 01:03:06.534
Ryu Sung Jae, all the best to you.

964
01:03:06.633 --> 01:03:08.811
Well, goodbye.

965
01:03:09.271 --> 01:03:10.530
This is definitely him.

966
01:03:11.588 --> 01:03:13.722
Maybe this is fate.

967
01:03:13.746 --> 01:03:15.005
Salt!

968
01:03:15.305 --> 01:03:18.717
It can't be changed
and you can’t refuse it.

969
01:03:18.741 --> 01:03:22.154
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

970
01:03:22.178 --> 01:03:24.995
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

